abstract: >-
  A small, readable simulator of the da Vinci Research Kit (dVRK) in pure
  Python, with minros, a miniature ROS, and a browser-based endoscope view
  for teleoperation exercises.
keywords:
  - dVRK
  - surgical robotics
  - teleoperation
